{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I have always had an idea to adapt MIDI music into a game, so I started learning how to program and make games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So I incorporated some elements of music performance into the fighting game, such as music skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At present, the early access has all the features I want in this game, including:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. There are various rhythm patterns in the music, as well as special split beat rhythms. Such as SWING, triplets, sixteenth notes, dotted notes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. The rhythm patterns of drums and light and heavy rhythms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The following content will be updated in the official version</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Characters with various music combos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. MIDI music can be imported and directly converted into levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Players create a motive and develop it into a complete genre of music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Imitate the works of music masters for imitation creation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Improvise interesting themes with different modes and rhythm patterns</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Group name:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >String Theory Exchange Group</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Group number:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >374813001</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"","localized_name":"\u8d85\u901f\u72c2\u9b54","name":"\u8d85\u901f\u72c2\u9b54","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1129760/"},{"icon":"","localized_name":"\u5206\u624b\u5927\u5e08","name":"\u5206\u624b\u5927\u5e08","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1129760/"},{"icon":"","localized_name":"\u5c60\u6740\u72c2\u4eba","name":"\u5c60\u6740\u72c2\u4eba","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steam